flowchart TD
    User((User))
    PostService[Post Service]
    ModerationQueue[(Moderation Queue)]
    AIClassifier[AI Content Classifier]
    HumanReviewer((Human Reviewer))
    PolicyEngine{Policy Engine}
    PublishService[Publish Service]
    NotifyService[Notification Service]
    AppealService[Appeal Service]

    User -->|submits post| PostService
    PostService -->|enqueue for review| ModerationQueue
    ModerationQueue -->|send to classifier| AIClassifier
    AIClassifier -->|flag as uncertain| HumanReviewer
    AIClassifier -->|auto-approve| PolicyEngine
    HumanReviewer -->|submit decision| PolicyEngine
    PolicyEngine -->|approve| PublishService
    PolicyEngine -->|reject| NotifyService
    PublishService -->|notify author| NotifyService
    User -->|files appeal| AppealService
    AppealService -->|re-queue for review| ModerationQueue
